            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "<ul>\r\n    <li>Our projects can be seen on all continents: from studios in London to startups in California. We work with all countries, anywhere on earth and at any time of the day.<\/li>\r\n    <li>We create product renders not only taking into account the basic rules, but also taking into account technical innovations, which allows us to implement renders for our clients faster. Our company has an internal academy, according to the rules of which our 3D-artists are trained on our own projects.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Our team speaks a huge number of languages: <strong>English, Spanish, Turkish, German, and French.<\/strong><\/li>\r\n    <li>Countries where clients have already left positive reviews of our work: Germany, the USA, the UK, Cameroon, Malta, the UAE, France, the Netherlands, Sweden, Saudi Arabia, Ethiopia, Canada, Australia, Austria, Benin, Singapore, Finland, Belgium, Switzerland, Lithuania, Denmark, Ireland, and Nova Scotia.<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
