            "type": "textarea",
            "instructions": "",
            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "To make our renders and models look as photorealistic as possible, our specialists have a number of programs for creating 3D visualizations. 3ds Max is the main program for our work, most often used to create visualizations and complex models. Our specialists use Blender to optimize models and texturing. Autodesk Maya helps renders achieve a cinematic effect, and ZBrush for detailed sculpting and complex organic forms. We also use a number of programs for creating animation. Thanks to the combination of all the tools, we create adaptive renders for any format quickly and photorealistically. Before choosing a tool, it is important to consider where the model will ultimately be placed.",
