            },
            "default_value": "We carefully study every brief so we can start fast and deliver on point. From minivans to superyachts, our specialists (7+ years’ experience) turn ideas into production-ready visuals using 3ds Max, Autodesk Maya, Blender, ZBrush, SketchUp, Fusion 360, and Rhino. Every deliverable—from still renders to multi-frame animations—is built for photorealism, following core principles of composition, lighting, and color. We also handle precise post-production—refining shadowing, white balance, and micro-details—so the image matches the real product as closely as possible.",
